---
title: Igris Inertial Cost Tracking Architecture
---

flowchart TD
    Client[Client Request] --> LB[Load Balancer]
    LB --> GW[Igris API Gateway]
    
    GW --> CT[Cost Tracker]
    CT --> Auth[Authentication & Tenant ID]
    Auth --> Router[Route Decision]
    
    Router --> CC[Cost Calculator]
    CC --> BM[Budget Manager]
    BM --> BudgetCheck{Budget Sufficient?}
    
    BudgetCheck -->|Yes| ShadowFlow[Shadow Mode Flow]
    BudgetCheck -->|No| ProductionFlow[Production Mode Flow]
    
    ShadowFlow --> Rust[Rust Optimizer]
    Rust --> Provider1[AI Provider 1]
    
    ProductionFlow --> Provider2[Selected Provider]
    
    Provider1 --> MT[Metrics Collector]
    Provider2 --> MT
    
    MT --> MC[Budget Monitoring Dashboard]
    MC --> AlertSystem[Alert System]
    
    AlertSystem --> Notification[Notification Service]
    
    MT --> DB[Cost Database]
    DB --> MetricsAPI[Metrics API Endpoints]
    
    MetricsAPI --> Prometheus[Prometheus Metrics]
    MetricsAPI --> ClientUI[Client Dashboard]
    
    style CT fill:#e1f5fe
    style BM fill:#fff3e0
    style MT fill:#f3e5f5
    style CC fill:#e0f2f1
    style MC fill:#fce4ec


